  <title>Getting started</title>
  <updated>2026-10-19T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
  <author><name>DocKitty Example</name></author>
  <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://spec-kitty.github.io/doc-kitty/guides/getting-started/"/>
  <summary>Where to start, whether you build your own docsite with DocKitty or work on this example site.</summary>
  <content type="html">&lt;span id=&quot;getting-started&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;build-your-own-docsite&quot;&gt;Build your own docsite&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To use DocKitty in your own project, install the published toolkit from GitHub
Packages: &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/doc-kitty/guides/install/&quot;&gt;Install the toolkit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; walks through the Node
floor, the Astro 7 and Starlight 0.42 peers, the registry setup and a first
build. Upgrading from 0.3? That guide links the migration guide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;work-on-this-example-site&quot;&gt;Work on this example site&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This site is the worked example in the
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/spec-kitty/doc-kitty&quot;&gt;doc-kitty repository&lt;/a&gt;. To run it from
a clone, at the repository root:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use Node 22.22 or later, enable pnpm and install:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;expressive-code&quot;&gt;&lt;figure class=&quot;frame is-terminal not-content&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;sr-only&quot;&gt;Terminal window&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre data-language=&quot;sh&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;corepack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;enable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;pnpm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;install&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run the dev server:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;expressive-code&quot;&gt;&lt;figure class=&quot;frame is-terminal not-content&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;sr-only&quot;&gt;Terminal window&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre data-language=&quot;sh&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;pnpm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;dev&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are looking at &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;example/docs/README.md&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add a page with correct frontmatter:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;expressive-code&quot;&gt;&lt;figure class=&quot;frame is-terminal not-content&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;sr-only&quot;&gt;Terminal window&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;pre data-language=&quot;sh&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ec-line&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;node&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;src/scripts/new-doc.mjs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;guides/my-recipe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;--title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D&quot;&gt;My recipe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;--base&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0&quot;&gt;example/docs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/rss.xml&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/llms.txt&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/api/index.json&lt;/code&gt; — the new page appears
in each, driven by its metadata.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;</content>
</entry>
